---
// Figma Curs5: cursusboek
---
<section class="book">
  <div class="container book-inner">
    <h2>De enthousiaste leerling begint thuis.</h2>
    <div class="book-stage">
      <img class="book-cover" src="/images/boek-cover.webp" alt="" width="393" height="295" loading="lazy" />
      <img class="book-open" src="/images/boek-open.webp" alt="Opengeslagen BeginBHV cursusboek" width="541" height="378" loading="lazy" />
    </div>
    <div class="book-row">
      <div class="book-text">
        <h3>Verrijk je BHV-kennis met ons cursusboek!</h3>
        <p>Ben je op zoek naar een veilige werkomgeving? Ons BeginBHV cursusboek "Werk ook compleet veilig" (8,8 sterren) is de ideale aanvulling op je BHV-cursus. Het biedt info over veiligheidsopleidingen, keuringen van AED's en brandblussers, EHBO-artikelen en advies voor risicopreventie.</p>
        <p>Leer over ongevalpreventie, veilige werkplekken en ARBO-regels.</p>
        <p>Bestel nu: "Wij wensen je een leerzame en plezierige cursusdag toe!"<br />Voeg het toe voor 30.- en upgrade je veiligheid vandaag!</p>
      </div>
      <div class="book-card reveal">
        <h3>BHV én meer!</h3>
        <p class="order"><strong>Bestel nu:</strong><br />Voeg het toe voor 30.- en upgrade je veiligheid vandaag!</p>
        <div class="book-thumbs" aria-hidden="true">
          <img src="/images/boek-cover.webp" alt="" width="120" height="90" loading="lazy" />
          <img src="/images/boek-open.webp" alt="" width="165" height="115" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <p class="price"><strong>29.99.-</strong><br />incl. btw</p>
        <a class="cart" href="/contact">Voeg toe aan winkelmand</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .book { background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,0,0,.1) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 100%), #fff; }
  .book-inner { padding-top: 61px; padding-bottom: 28px; }
  h2 { font-family: var(--f-head); font-weight: 900; font-size: var(--t-h2); text-align: center; line-height: 1.85; }
  .book-stage { position: relative; height: 420px; margin-top: 0; }
  .book-open { position: absolute; left: 278px; top: 0; width: 541px; height: 378px; object-fit: contain; }
  .book-cover { position: absolute; left: 683px; top: 42px; width: 393px; height: 295px; object-fit: contain; }
  .book-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 479px; gap: 40px; padding-left: 68px; padding-right: 28px; margin-top: 30px; }
  .book-text h3 { font-family: var(--f-head); font-weight: 300; font-size: var(--t-h3); line-height: 1.25; }
  .book-text p { font-family: var(--f-head); font-weight: 300; font-size: var(--t-md); line-height: 1.25; margin-top: 20px; max-width: 668px; }
  .book-text p + p { margin-top: 20px; }
  .book-card { position: relative; height: 274px; background: var(--c-light); border-radius: var(--r-md); box-shadow: var(--sh-card); padding: 36px 0 0 26px; }
  .book-card h3 { font-family: var(--f-head); font-weight: 900; font-size: var(--t-lg); }
  .order { font-family: var(--f-head); font-weight: 300; font-size: var(--t-md); width: 243px; margin-top: 7px; line-height: 1.25; }
  .order strong { font-weight: 700; }
  .book-thumbs { position: absolute; left: 217px; top: 20px; width: 245px; height: 125px; }
  .book-thumbs img:last-child { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; width: 165px; height: 115px; object-fit: contain; }
  .book-thumbs img:first-child { position: absolute; left: 123px; top: 13px; width: 120px; height: 90px; object-fit: contain; }
  .price { font-family: var(--f-head); font-weight: 300; font-size: var(--t-lg); margin-top: 18px; line-height: 1.3; }
  .price strong { font-weight: 800; }
  .cart {
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-align: center;
    width: 156px; height: 47.3px; margin-top: 8px; border-radius: 4.3px;
    background: var(--c-green-dark); color: var(--c-white);
    font-family: var(--f-head); font-weight: 300; font-size: var(--t-md); line-height: 1.15;
  }
  @media (max-width: 1100px) {
    .book-stage { height: auto; display: flex; justify-content: center; }
    .book-open, .book-cover { position: static; }
    .book-cover { display: none; }
    .book-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding-inline: 0; }
    .book-card { height: auto; padding-bottom: 24px; }
    .book-thumbs { display: none; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 700px) { h2 { font-size: 26px; line-height: 1.3; } .book-text h3 { font-size: 26px; } }
</style>
